---

The default build of xq has no third-party dependencies and vendors no
third-party code.

The optional zstd codec, enabled only with `make WITH_ZSTD=1`, links against
Zstandard (https://github.com/facebook/zstd), which is dual-licensed under
BSD-3-Clause and GPL-2.0. Zstandard is not distributed with xq; the default
build does not link against it.

src/common/xq_xxh64.c is an independent implementation of the XXH64
specification by Yann Collet. It contains no code from the reference
implementation. The algorithm is in the public domain.
